+# Eleven-drive inventory and explicit Nano experiments
+
+## Scope and source
+
+Ordinary baseline tree: `0a34d588488c09f9a7fd4d8bc6115be61bdcd750` (production main b0b4e5ab). The app's unconfigured New Game path selects Nano512. Explicit N2048 and scaled-choice recipes are different experiments. Nothing here establishes the user's current loaded class or modifies acquired state.
+
+The default compiled recurrent graph does not carry these eleven inputs to candidate readout. That statement alone is incomplete: canonical birth dendrites cross the last motor boundary (495 reads reserve496), giving hunger a tiny measured indirect path. Sleep structural growth may create other learned paths. No assertion that all possible learned creatures are disconnected is justified.
+
+All lane/neuron mappings below are actual default Nano mappings. Existing innate biases bypass neural reachability. Signs and coefficients are not universal action logits: cues, reach, masks and maximum-over-drive selection matter. The full measured arrays at 1/4/16/32 frames (4/16/64/128 microsteps), with unchanged/zero/active V1 branches, are preserved in `drive-routing-v1-measurements.json`.
+
+| Drive | Lane / neuron | Physiology and feedback | Default effective route and innate readout | Grounded action / remaining limit |
+|---|---|---|---|---|
+| Hunger | 0 / 64 | Energy deficit +.18; nutrition −.30, nutrient supplies ATP | Recurrent→reserve496..506 plus birth boundary→motor495; tiny motor delta up to1.192e−6 at32 frames. Innate suppresses nonfood families, favors Approach/Ingest with food/reach cues | Ordinary ingestion relieves need. Sensible food targeting is separate from merely reaching a motor neuron |
+| Fatigue | 1 / 67 | Canonical waking +.00007 with .99995 retention; sleep recovery −.70, expression gated | No fresh compiled recurrent decoder path. Innate Rest positive coefficient3.84 | Rest/sleep supported; original chemistry too slow in the4514-tick upper-bound fixture. Separate calibration is not included here; newborn expression0 does not prove sleep relief |
+| Fear | 2 / 68 | Damage +.35, regulatory recovery | No fresh compiled decoder path; danger mask favors Avoid7.1424 with cue and suppresses idle/nonprotective families | Grounded movement/avoidance available; target/location and actual safety still matter |
+| Pain | 3 / 65 | Damage +.80, sustained severe health deficit +.1 above threshold.4; recovery | No fresh compiled decoder path; same danger mask. This does not replace separate peripheral withdrawal | Body damage, motion costs and relief remain world-owned; separate reflex candidate not included |
+| Loneliness | 4 / 69 | Regulatory rebound toward .15, real social contact −.60; not an unbounded alone accumulator | No default recurrent/birth readout; no direct innate family prior. Default detached loneliness changes activation but zero scores through128 microsteps | Developed actual contact .15→.0453754 at20 intervals→0 by40; separation after20→.146007 by100. Peer sensing/context does not itself create a privileged decoder label |
+| Curiosity | 5 / 70 | Perceived novelty +.04; investigation −.08, expression floor1 | No fresh decoder route or direct innate prior | Inspect and observed novelty are grounded; V1 availability alone is not demonstrated target-specific exploration |
+| Brain ATP | 6 / 71 | Nutrient reaction supplies availability, deficit consumes it; neural work costs real reserve. Canonical waking removes sleep ATP manufacture | No fresh decoder path or direct innate prior; physiology still constrains cognition | High means availability, not unmet need. Do not invert it into generalized distress or reward rest with free energy |
+| Temperature stress | 7 / 66 | Supplied thermal exposure +.30; physiological recovery. Ordinary production physics has no thermal event producer in this baseline | No fresh decoder path; unsigned danger mask can favor Avoid but supplies no refuge direction | Tactile temperature is not a qualified thermal refuge cue. Separate thermal prototype owns this gap |
+| Reproductive drive | 8 / 72 | Actual ambient opportunity +.85; developmental and energy readiness gating | No fresh decoder path or direct innate family prior | No ordinary mate action in this baseline. Adult eligibility at ATP.25 versus .249 and juvenile rejection tested separately; not a full reproductive policy |
+| Boredom (Extension0) | 9 / 73 | Awake +.0002; actual play −.2, expression floor1; value weight−.08 | No default fresh decoder path or innate prior | Actual toy play relieves need. Separate boredom candidate is not silently folded into this Nano experiment |
+| Reserved Extension1 | 10 / 74 | No assigned biological need in this recipe | Encoded but no fresh decoder route or innate prior | Reserved capacity, not a missing named emotion. V1 routing this lane proves availability only |
+
+## Negative experiments retained
+
+V1 availability bridge preserves coordinates and replaces22 of64 birth branches, input→reserve→planning with .25 gain per hop. It makes all eleven perturbations observable, but arbitrary old readouts give wrong directions: loneliness .1→.8 at32 frames decreases Approach .005541 and increases Avoid .011850 in the fixture. The actual 12-context ×8-interval CPU run has identical active/zero sampled choices and remains a closed negative policy result. No new life or optimizer update occurred.
+
+V2 attempted to route need into the old MemoryContext source and raise eight lane32 weights to .35. Source review proved this cannot gate anything: existing CPU and WGSL MemoryContext deliberately ignore source activation. V2 was source-only, never qualified or promoted. Its changes are preserved separately, not used as V3's base.
+
+## V3 bounded mechanism, not all-drive policy
+
+New recipe identities ZeroNeedMemoryGate and NeedMemoryGate append eight head5 rows. Old synapse indices, old weights and old readout semantics remain unchanged. Both retain the same relay budget/bias; only the new weights differ0/.35. Loneliness alone gets a reserve→MemoryInterface relay; other lanes reach reserve but are not indiscriminately connected to all actions. Head5 computes rectified final neural activity × signed recalled lane32 × effective weight under the existing memory clamp. The .25 relay gain per hop and .35 reader gain are conservative explicit test parameters, not an optimized or biologically proven calibration. The shared +.25 source bias makes a small readout-only component possible, so the relay-off control is necessary. A separate 2×2 relay-on/off × weight0/.35 assay distinguishes true coupling from the constant reader-bias effect.
+
+Lane32 is confidence-weighted acquired aggregate family valence from experienced consequences. Its provenance does not use hidden target kinds. Existing target memory represents hunger/fear/pain/curiosity/ATP consequences, novelty/contact/error, but does not separately encode loneliness/fatigue/temperature/reproduction/boredom relief. Thus even a successful V3 gate would be need-conditioned aggregate consequence valuation, not evidence of need-specific social memory or emotional experience.
+
+The predeclared acted fixture is unchanged/zero/active × peer/equally physical toy × initial loneliness .1/.8 ×32 intervals (384 total). No adaptive extension follows outcomes. Last-state detached replays use actual recall versus cleared lane32, pressure0/.1/.8, relay on/off, horizons1/8/32 frames, and report executed microsteps. These replays hold recalled samples, candidate features, innate biases, mutable banks, initial state and receptor context fixed; they perturb only the declared encoded pressure lane and optionally its first-hop relay. They are not a whole-body pressure intervention and are not acted policy. Newborn expression and passive decay remain explicit; developed contact relief was qualified separately above.
+
+At document preparation V3 native qualification is in progress. Final results, exact frozen source and logs must be attached before any success claim or promotion.
+
+### Initial V3 executed checks
+Core identity/source-prefix check1/1 and adapter-free GPU packing/WGSL validation3/3 passed. CPU neural-port4/4 passed, including effective-weight finite differences, upstream recurrent gradient, clamp, old-head independence and signed/empty recall. In the one-tick synthetic factorial, relay-off/readout-on scores0.039311364 at both pressures; relay-on/readout-off changes gate source0.16045456→0.16262226 but contributes zero score; combined scores0.039311364→0.039842453, effect+0.000531089. The generic bias component dominates. These are synthetic port checks, not learned social behavior or executed GPU validation. Eligibility, host/legacy preservation and ordinary physical fixtures remain pending at this stage.
+
+### Closed first native attempt and separate CPU parity defect
+The first384-interval plan did not complete. It executed128 unchanged-context intervals and12 zero-readout/nonpeer/low-need intervals, then failed on zero-based interval12 with `Training(Contract(InvalidDecisionEvidence))`. Stage diagnostics locate the failure in CPU speech decoding, before action staging. Nano has no speech decoder; a sampled vocal representative can still request a vocal channel. Existing WGSL clears speech and emits no payload in this case, leaving the world to record an ordinary missing-affordance outcome. CPU instead required1024 speech rows and rejected the step. No active-gate context was reached and no completed native artifact was produced.
+
+The absent-head CPU parity correction is a separate factor with a standalone patch/test; selected action, outcome evidence and malformed-present-head checks must remain intact. Any full rerun after that repair is revision2 of the fixed-plan qualification, not continuation or retrospective success of this attempt. Logs `nano-need-memory-native-failure-v3.log` and debug1–3 preserve the failure. All temporary host/fixture diagnostic code was removed; fixture source hash returned to de3628809ef21760e4b277a54f0680f0c1ac27f3fcd619c3527c0ea4952c0d2a.
+
+### Revision2 native result: closed negative, no promotion
+After the isolated absent-speech correction, all twelve contexts completed32 intervals (384 total), with unchanged optimizer. Every context had108 nonzero recalled lane32 samples across its decisions, including positive and negative acquired valence. Nevertheless all active/zero sampled action sequences were identical. The actual last-state detached pressure perturbations produced exactly zero logit deltas at1/8/32 frames, with and without the relay/recall controls. At32 frames the active gate source remained negative (approximately−.02565 for toy and−.02537 for peer), so the nonnegative gate correctly shut off. Do not substitute synthetic positive-source evidence for this actual operating-point failure.
+
+Physical relief remains real: high initial loneliness.8 ended.07993386 with peer contact versus.21665525 with the equally physical toy. Low.1 ended0 versus.02708191. This is neonatal contact plus passive decay, not verified mature fatigue relief. The completed fixture is closed; no parameter increase or further acted intervals were chosen after observing it. Artifact: `../nano-need-memory-native-v3r2.json`, SHA2566f0e21260fec2885bee195cd32b9b7955579fd96e4fd68a49106aa7e27e98a92; parsed contrasts: `../nano-need-memory-summary-v3r2.json`.
+
+The old-source preservation batch passed49 core tests, and host4/4 includes exact head5 checkpoint continuation and cross-control rejection. Separate absent-speech tests4/4 passed. Initial strict linting found only test-code borrow/Copy/chunk-loop issues; final strict result is recorded separately. Software Vulkan execution and independent successor source review remain unqualified until explicitly reported.
